CHAPTER.VERS:
and the things that you heard from me through many witnesses, these things be committing
entrusting to stedfast
reliable, faithful, trustworthy, dependable men, who will be sufficient also others to teach;

you, therefore, suffer evil 

          hardship
         as a good soldier of Jesus Christ;

in which I suffer evil 

          hardship
         -- unto bonds, as an evil-doer, but the word of God has not been bound;

Stedfast 

          faithful

         the word: For if we died together -- we also shall live together;
